project_id: "004"
proposer: "uid0"
name: "To IndiaFOSS, With Love"
desc: """
  We are five engineering students from IIT Guwahati, Assam. We are active contributors
  to various FOSS projects. We help organize local meetups, and help various people
  adopt FOSS.

  We also volunteer and run learning activities in a local(10+2) school, using Free and
  Open Source technologies. That said, we are painfully aware of the lack of awareness
  and opportunities available to these kids. One fine day, over our usual philosophical
  discussions, we asked ourselves, \"What if these folks got an opportunity to experience
  IndiaFOSS?\".

  IndiaFOSS is a vibrant technical festival, a geek's dream. But more importantly, it's
  a place where everyone is exposed to the entire spectrum of technologies - spanning
  not just software, but also hardware at various levels.

  It was 5 AM in the morning when we finished our philosophy detour. We were at the school
  at 9 AM. By 10 AM the school teacher was excited. And then we got cracking.

  Right now, we have a group of 24 students willing to travel all the way from Assam
  to Bengaluru. School teachers on the ready. And us too - to show them their paces
  in the conference and guide them at every step of the way.

  Help fund this dream of ours, and see you at IndiaFOSS. We'll keep you informed
  and entertained, and that's a promise! And the students and teachers will be back
  with a bang, bursting with new ideas, and ... a lot could happen over the next year
  with your support as the starting point.

  PS: we are requesting funding for roughly 80% of the cost, courtesy support of some
  good samaritans from Bengaluru. Your funding will cover the ticket cost(3AC) and
  some of the travel logistics for the entire group, excluding us students.
"""
funding_range:: 120000
campaign_url: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=project-campaign-video-id"
categories:: "short-term", "nascent"
licenses:: "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
